<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Perfil</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/app.css}">
</head>
<body>
	<nav th:replace="~{fragments :: nav}"></nav>
	<main class="container">
		<div class="page-head">
			<div>
				<h1 th:text="${form.id == null ? 'Novo perfil' : 'Editar perfil'}"></h1>
				<p>Selecione exatamente as ações que este perfil poderá
					executar.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="alert error" th:if="${erro}" th:text="${erro}"></div>
		<form class="panel form-grid" th:action="@{/admin/perfis/salvar}"
			th:object="${form}" method="post">
			<input type="hidden" th:field="*{id}"> <label>Código<input
				type="text" th:field="*{codigo}" required placeholder="EX.: AUDITOR"><small
				class="field-error" th:errors="*{codigo}"></small></label> <label>Nome<input
				type="text" th:field="*{nome}" required><small
				class="field-error" th:errors="*{nome}"></small></label> <label class="full">Descrição<input
				type="text" th:field="*{descricao}"></label>
			<div class="full">
				<h3>Permissões</h3>
				<div class="permission-grid">
					<label class="permission-item" th:each="p:${permissoes}"><input
						type="checkbox" th:field="*{permissaoIds}" th:value="${p.id}"><span><strong
							th:text="${p.nome}"></strong>
						<code th:text="${p.codigo}"></code><small th:text="${p.descricao}"></small></span></label>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="full actions">
				<button class="primary btn" type="submit">Salvar perfil</button>
				<a class="btn secondary" th:href="@{/admin/perfis}">Cancelar</a>
			</div>
		</form>
	</main>
</body>
</html>
